  "answer": "To claim your EUR 200 compensation for the 2-hour arrival delay, you need to submit a claim through Corvina Airways' online form within 12 months of your flight date. Compensation is paid by bank transfer within 30 days or, if you prefer, as a travel voucher worth 130% of the amount, valid for 12 months. Make sure to include your flight details and proof of the delay when submitting your claim.",
